SUMMARY:CHIIR 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM SIGIR Conference on Human Information Interaction and Retri
 eval\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://ch
 iir2027.github.io/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#c
 hiir-2027\nNotes: Official CHIIR 2027 pages\, checked 2026-10-31\, confir
 m an in-person meeting at Humboldt-Universität zu Berlin\, Mar 7-11\, 20
 27 (doctoral consortium Mar 7\; tutorials and workshops Mar 11)\; deadlin
 es are 23:59 AoE. The abstract gates full and perspective papers. Short\,
  resource\, demo/design and industry papers (4 pages\, all in the proceed
 ings) closed Oct 29 with no extension shown\; the demo/design and industr
 y tracks are not stored as events. The doctoral consortium takes single-a
 uthored PhD student papers. ACM open-access proceedings (APCs outside ACM
  Open). Size S reflects 116 registered participants and 63 accepted paper
 s at CHIIR 2026 (SIGIR Forum report). Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Information Retrieval & Search,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment
URL:https://chiir2027.github.io/
LOCATION:Berlin\, Germany
